    "notes": "Album assembled from multiple sessions between November 1962 and March 1963 at Columbia 30th Street Studio. Original 8-track LP contains no bonus tracks; CD reissues add Pannonica, Coming on the Hudson, and alternate takes. Engineer not documented in available sources. Recording dates per Wikipedia: Nov 6, 1962 - March 29, 1963. Per jazzdisco.org, sessions also occurred on Oct 31, Nov 1, Nov 2, and Nov 6, 1962, and further Feb-Mar 1963 dates."
